  "summary": "I am an experienced Technical Manager with a successful track record in developing products from the business development phase to the product acceptance sign-off. I am a versatile professional with excellent hands-on experience in various System and Software roles. This trait along with my experience has helped me become an entrepreneur.\n\nMy experience has given me a unique perspective on how to correctly execute the Product Development Life Cycle (PDLC) and work with people. Over the years, I have developed excellent professional relationships with domestic and international customers by listening to customer’s concerns and negotiating a common ground that benefits both companies. \n\nI had the pleasure of working in the Telecommunication and Defense industry which has peaked my interest in Cybersecurity.  I have obtained DoD Secret Clearances on various occasions and a DHS Customs and Border Protection Suitability Clearance.  I have further my knowledge by taking Cybersecurity courses.\n\nPlease see my work history for a detail description of my proficiencies. \n\nThank you for taking the time to read my Linkedin page. \n",
